<title>USA: Santa Fe Gaming Corp Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Santa Fe Gaming Corp Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<text>
<p>LAS VEGAS, Feb 14 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     loss $0.62	     loss $0.58</p>
<p> Net		 loss 3,800	     loss 3,600</p>
<p> Revs		25,400		   28,100</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago results include a gain of $40.8 million before taxes, or $4.34 per share, from the sale of substantially all the assets of the Sahara Hotel and Casino.</p>
